तथा प्रलीनस्तमसि मूढयोनिषु जायते ॥ १५ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3913,\"bb\":3442,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/14/15/b3442/\",\"body_value\":\"rajasi pralayaṁ gatvā
karma-saṅgiṣu jāyate
tathā pralīnas tamasi
mūḍha-yoniṣu jāyate\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":3914,\"bb\":3443,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/14/15/b3443/\",\"shadow_value\":\"rajasi – in passion; pralayam – dissolution; gatvā – attaining; karma-saṅgiṣu – in the association of those engaged in fruitive activities; jāyate – takes birth; tathā – similarly; pralīnaḥ – being dissolved; tamasi – in ignorance; mūḍha-yoniṣu – in animal species; jāyate – takes birth.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"rajasi\",\"translation\":\"in passion\"},{\"word\":\"pralayam\",\"translation\":\"dissolution\"},{\"word\":\"gatvā\",\"translation\":\"attaining\"},{\"word\":\"karma-saṅgiṣu\",\"translation\":\"in the association of those engaged in fruitive activities\"},{\"word\":\"jāyate\",\"translation\":\"takes birth\"},{\"word\":\"tathā\",\"translation\":\"similarly\"},{\"word\":\"pralīnaḥ\",\"translation\":\"being dissolved\"},{\"word\":\"tamasi\",\"translation\":\"in ignorance\"},{\"word\":\"mūḍha-yoniṣu\",\"translation\":\"in animal species\"},{\"word\":\"jāyate\",\"translation\":\"takes birth\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":3915,\"bb\":3444,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/14/15/b3444/\",\"body_value\":\"When one dies in the mode of passion, he takes birth among those engaged in fruitive activities; and when one dies in the mode of ignorance, he takes birth in the animal kingdom.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3916,\"bb\":3445,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/14/15/b3445/\",\"body_value\":\"Some people have the impression that when the soul reaches the platform of human life it never goes down again. This is incorrect. According to this verse, if one develops the mode of ignorance, after his death he is degraded to an animal form of life. From there one has to again elevate himself, by an evolutionary process, to come again to the human form of life. Therefore, those who are actually serious about human life should take to the mode of goodness and in good association transcend the modes and become situated in Kṛṣṇa consciousness. This is the aim of human life. Otherwise, there is no guarantee that the human being will again attain to the human status.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 14.15\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 14.15\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"29:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n2f:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"breadcrumb mb-8 text-base\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/\",{\"className\":\"inline\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"href\":\"/en/library/\",\"className\":\"text-vb-link\",\"children\":\"Library\"}],\" » \"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/bg/\",{\"className\":\"inline\",\"