bhavato ’jñānam eva ca\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":3929,\"bb\":3456,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/14/17/b3456/\",\"shadow_value\":\"sattvāt – from the mode of goodness; sañjāyate – develops; jñānam – knowledge; rajasaḥ – from the mode of passion; lobhaḥ – greed; eva – certainly; ca – also; pramāda – madness; mohau – and illusion; tamasaḥ – from the mode of ignorance; bhavataḥ – develop; ajñānam – nonsense; eva – certainly; ca – also.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"sattvāt\",\"translation\":\"from the mode of goodness\"},{\"word\":\"sañjāyate\",\"translation\":\"develops\"},{\"word\":\"jñānam\",\"translation\":\"knowledge\"},{\"word\":\"rajasaḥ\",\"translation\":\"from the mode of passion\"},{\"word\":\"lobhaḥ\",\"translation\":\"greed\"},{\"word\":\"eva\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"pramāda\",\"translation\":\"madness\"},{\"word\":\"mohau\",\"translation\":\"and illusion\"},{\"word\":\"tamasaḥ\",\"translation\":\"from the mode of ignorance\"},{\"word\":\"bhavataḥ\",\"translation\":\"develop\"},{\"word\":\"ajñānam\",\"translation\":\"nonsense\"},{\"word\":\"eva\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":3930,\"bb\":3457,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/14/17/b3457/\",\"body_value\":\"From the mode of goodness, real knowledge develops; from the mode of passion, greed develops; and from the mode of ignorance develop foolishness, madness and illusion.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3931,\"bb\":3458,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/14/17/b3458/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 14.